<title>CANADA: GM Canada sales rise 34 pct in April.</title>
<headline>GM Canada sales rise 34 pct in April.</headline>
<dateline>OSHAWA, Ontario 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Motors of Canada Ltd, a wholly owned unit of General Motors Corp, said on Thursday its sales for April were as follows:</p>
<p>		     PCT CHANGE	    1997	     1996</p>
<p>   Total	   +34		     43,393	   32,379</p>
<p>   Cars	    +35		     24,857	   18,358</p>
<p>   Trucks	  +32.2		   18,536	   14,021</p>
<p>   YEAR-TO-DATE  PCT CHANGE	    1997	     1996</p>
<p>   Total	   +11.9		  228,004	  203,760</p>
<p>   Cars	    +8.6		   125,085	  115,182</p>
<p>   Trucks	  +16.2		  102,919	   88,578</p>
<p>((Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100))</p>
</text>
